  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="74">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Abt">Abt</ref> 74</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="74" corresp="#wit-h">Mægþbot sy swa friges mannes.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#oliver" n="73" corresp="#wit-h">Mægþbot sy swa friges mannes.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#oliver" corresp="#wit-h">Compensation for [injury to/offense against] a maiden shall be as for a free man.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#attenborough" corresp="#wit-h">Compensation [for injury] to be paid to an unmarried woman, shall be on the same scale as that paid to a freeman.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#whitelock" corresp="#wit-h">The compensation for [injury to] a maiden is to be as for a freeman.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">[Die für Verletzung einer] Jungfrau [zu entrichtende] Busse sei so [hoch] wie [für die Verletzung] eines freien Mannes.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">The compensation [to be paid for injury to a] maiden is to be as [high] as [for injury to] a free man.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
